<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong seizes nearly 100,000 smuggled VCDs.</title>
<headline>Guangdong seizes nearly 100,000 smuggled VCDs.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Customs officials in China's southern Guangdong province have seized 99,500 pornographic or pirated video compact discs (VCDs) smuggled in from Hong Kong, the Shenzhen Special Zone Daily said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Custom officials found the smuggled VCDs stored in a passenger ship in Shantou city on May 7, said the newspaper. The paper is published in the southern Chinese city of Shenzhen, which borders Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Two mainland Chinese crew members from the ship are being sought by police in connection with the seizure, it added.</p>
</text>
